ebirdgroup.com/promo/mission-complete-1st-transaction?lang=id"],"reviewedDate":"2026-10-19","countryFacts":[{"country":"Indonesia","fact":"Prime launch release names Jakarta, Bandung, Surabaya, Medan and Bali. This is the product launch footprint, not every group operating location.","sourceUrl":"https://www.bluebirdgroup.com/news/bluebird-perluas-ekosistem-mobilitas-dengan-hadirkan-bluebird-prime?lang=id"}]},"reviewedRecordCount":6,"reviewedEvidence":[{"id":"bluebird-bsi-expo-promo-20261023","date":"2026-10-23","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Bluebird targets BSI Expo trips with a card-linked offer","summary":"Bluebird published a 23–25 October MyBluebird promotion for JCC trips: 20% off, capped at Rp15,000, with an eligible BSI Hasanah Card.","implication":"Analyst view: compare event-specific partner offers on incremental rides and subsidy-adjusted contribution.","nextAction":"Check funding split, incremental bookings and repeat usage after the event.","url":"https://www.bluebirdgroup.com/promo/bsiexpo26?lang=en","source":"Bluebird Group","limitations":"Eligibility and fare exclusions apply. A promotion establishes neither durable demand growth nor market share."},{"id":"bluebird-solo-20261017","date":"2026-10-17","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Bluebird expands Solo fleet to 100 taxis; MyBluebird accounts for 47% of bookings","summary":"ANTARA reported that Bluebird expanded its Solo/Surakarta fleet to 100 taxis in total. The local business reported average quarterly demand growth of 17% and a 47% MyBluebird booking share.","implication":"Compare city-level fleet density, advance booking and service reliability with GoCar; these local figures do not establish national market share.","nextAction":"Validate the period and denominator behind the growth and booking figures, then compare matched-city ride economics.","url":"https://jateng.antaranews.com/berita/648929/bluebird-tambah-armada-jadi-100-unit-sebagai-respon-lonjakan-penumpang","source":"ANTARA Jateng","limitations":"Company statements reported by ANTARA; Solo only. 100 is the resulting fleet, not 100 additional vehicles. Quarterly growth is not annualised."},{"id":"local-bluebird-20261019-4","date":"2026-09-30","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"MyBluebird links first-transaction missions to loyalty rewards","summary":"Accounts registered from 1 July to 30 September 2026 without a prior transaction could earn a Rp5,000 later-trip code by completing their first transaction during 1–31 October.","implication":"Test whether a reward earned on a first trip generates a profitable second trip rather than subsidising already-active riders.","nextAction":"Use a holdout cohort and measure second-trip conversion and contribution after rewards.","url":"https://www.bluebirdgroup.com/promo/mission-complete-1st-transaction?lang=id","source":"Bluebird Group","limitations":"Issuer claims; independent performance verification and GoTo transferability remain separate."},{"id":"local-bluebird-20261019-3","date":"2026-07-16","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Bluebird launches Prime with hybrid and electric fleets","summary":"Bluebird announced Prime using Toyota Innova Zenix Hybrid and BYD E6 vehicles, with launch availability in Jakarta and BYD E6 service in Bandung, Surabaya, Medan and Bali.","implication":"Test demand for a clearly defined premium ride tier, balancing willingness to pay against fleet and driver costs.","nextAction":"Compare incremental contribution, utilisation and cannibalisation against existing GoCar tiers.","url":"https://www.bluebirdgroup.com/news/bluebird-perluas-ekosistem-mobilitas-dengan-hadirkan-bluebird-prime?lang=id","source":"Bluebird Group","limitations":"Issuer claims; independent performance verification and GoTo transferability remain separate."},{"id":"local-bluebird-20261019-2","date":"2026-06-18","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Bluebird shareholders approve Rp166 per-share dividend","summary":"The AGM approved Rp166 per share from FY2025 earnings. The release scheduled payment for 10 July 2026; payment completion is not verified by this announcement.","implication":"Consider the balance between fleet investment, cash generation and shareholder distributions when comparing capital intensity.","nextAction":"Check payment completion and the FY2025 attributable-earnings denominator.","url":"https://www.bluebirdgroup.com/news/bluebird-setujui-dividen-rp166-per-saham-perkuat-fondasi-pertumbuhan-jangka-panjang?lang=en","source":"Bluebird Group","limitations":"Issuer claims; independent performance verification and GoTo transferability remain separate."}]}